{"facts":[{"id":"fact_new_1","kind":"could_use","text":"Dunk wears an uninscribed magical ring taken from a dead dwarf's finger in the Dwarven mine cave-in. Wearing it let him see and speak with Grimny's ghost, whom no one else could see.","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":true,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"medium","actionability":"medium","evidence":["beat_70","beat_71","beat_72","beat_79"]},{"id":"fact_new_2","kind":"unknown","text":"Is the dead dwarf's ring cursed? Dunk felt a growing urge he could not resist to put it on.","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":true,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"medium","actionability":"medium","evidence":["beat_71","beat_72"]},{"id":"fact_new_3","kind":"unknown","text":"What else does the ring do beyond letting Dunk see Grimny's ghost, and does it reveal other ghosts now that Grimny has ascended?","state":"open","change":"new","ended_how":null,"learned_this_session":true,"definite_end":null,"possibly_moot":null,"certainty":"established","uncertain_reason":null,"about_thread":null,"also_bears_on":[],"importance":"low","actionability":"medium","evidence":["beat_71","beat_72","beat_81"]}]}